# Cross-origin isolation, which is what lets onnxruntime run the OCR encoder on
# several threads (SharedArrayBuffer). Without these two headers the browser
# reports crossOriginIsolated=false and the model runs on one core.
#
# `credentialless` rather than `require-corp`: it lets the song database and
# Google Fonts load as ordinary anonymous cross-origin fetches without needing
# them to send Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
